This directory mirrors the ext2 root filesystem hierarchy.

- bin/ contains userspace executables.
- etc/ contains system configuration and startup scripts.
- home/user/ contains user scripts and shell state.
- lib/rhai/ contains importable Rhai modules.
- usr/share/felix/ contains shared images and other assets.

The image builder also creates tmp/ and var/. `/init` and `/kernel.bin` are
installed separately because they are required by the boot path.
